  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d7580879a6c3ad34dac19f29f1c235e0, type: 3}
  m_Name: AuntieStews
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNodeData
  lines:
  - Stews are important. Not only do they offer protection, they also give off smells
    that can attract certain critters. Or scare them away...
  - In order to make stews you will need to bring me some critters. Then I can butcher
    them into ingredients at the table.
  - With some ingredients you can cook at the cauldron. Each variation is unique.
    You'll see when you experiment with it.
  choices: []
  defaultNextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d25aba5dbbe0eb141a6ff2fafde883e9, type: 2}
